{"seq":2,"slug":"continuum-crowds","title":"连续介质人群","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/crowds/continuum-crowds","wordCount":1798,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"连续介质人群\">连续介质人群</h1><p>当人群规模上到几千、几万，而且大家有着共同或相近的目标（疏散、撤离、RTS 里成片单位涌向集结点）时，逐个体计算力的微观方法——无论是 <a href=\"../foundations/boids-model\">Boids</a> 还是 <a href=\"social-force-model\">社会力模型</a>——都会显得既昂贵又局促。2006 年 Treuille、Cooper 和 Popović 在 SIGGRAPH 上提出连续介质人群（Continuum Crowds），换了个完全不同的视角：<strong>不再把人群看成一堆粒子，而看成一团会流动的连续介质</strong>，像水一样用场方程一次性算出整片人群该往哪流。这是本 hub 里宏观建模路线的代表作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>连续介质人群的核心洞见是：有共同目标的人群，其个体的最优路径决策可以归结为一个<strong>全局最优控制问题</strong>——每个人都想用&quot;最小代价&quot;抵达目标，而代价由路程、耗时和拥挤共同决定。把这个决策对整片人群同时求解，就得到一个势场（potential field），人群顺着势场的负梯度流动，就像水往低处流。</p>\n<p>它建立在三条假设之上，这也正是它与微观模型的分野：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>假设</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>带来的能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>群体目标一致</td>\n<td>一组人共享目标点/区域</td>\n<td>可对整组统一求解势场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个体走最小代价路径</td>\n<td>综合距离、时间、拥挤</td>\n<td>自动绕开拥堵，无需显式避让</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拥挤反馈进代价</td>\n<td>密度越高、通过代价越大</td>\n<td>人群自发分流、负载均衡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最关键的第三条假设让连续介质人群有了微观模型难以企及的能力：<strong>避障与拥堵规避被融进了同一个势场求解里</strong>，不需要单独的避让逻辑——人群会像水绕开石头一样自动避开稠密区。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    D[人群密度场 rho] --&gt; SP[速度场 speed field&lt;br/&gt;密度越高速度越低]&#10;    SP --&gt; CF[代价场 cost field&lt;br/&gt;= 时间+路程+不适]&#10;    G[目标区域] --&gt; EIK[解 Eikonal 方程&lt;br/&gt;得势场 phi]&#10;    CF --&gt; EIK&#10;    EIK --&gt; GRAD[势场负梯度&lt;br/&gt;= 流动方向]&#10;    GRAD --&gt; MV[推进各 agent]&#10;    MV --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    D[人群密度场 rho] --&gt; SP[速度场 speed field&lt;br/&gt;密度越高速度越低]\n    SP --&gt; CF[代价场 cost field&lt;br/&gt;= 时间+路程+不适]\n    G[目标区域] --&gt; EIK[解 Eikonal 方程&lt;br/&gt;得势场 phi]\n    CF --&gt; EIK\n    EIK --&gt; GRAD[势场负梯度&lt;br/&gt;= 流动方向]\n    GRAD --&gt; MV[推进各 agent]\n    MV --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"从密度场到速度场\">从密度场到速度场</h2><p>整个流程从一个<strong>密度场</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho(\\vec{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 开始：把每个 agent 的&quot;质量&quot;按某种核函数抹到周围网格上，叠加成连续的人群密度。密度高的格子意味着拥挤。</p>\n<p>接着定义<strong>速度场</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\vec{x}, \\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——人群在位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、沿方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 能走多快。Treuille 用了一个分段模型：密度低于阈值时是自由流动速度（受地形坡度影响），密度高于阈值时进入&quot;流体流动&quot;区，速度随密度上升而线性下降。这恰好对应行人动力学里经验性的密度-速度关系，也是下一篇 <a href=\"density-flow-control\">密度与流量控制</a> 要展开的&quot;基本图&quot;。直觉很朴素：越挤走得越慢。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价场与-eikonal-方程\">代价场与 Eikonal 方程</h2><p>有了速度场，就能定义沿某条微元路径前进的<strong>单位代价</strong>。Treuille 把代价设计成三项的加权：路程长度、所花时间、以及一个&quot;不适场&quot;（discomfort，比如要避开危险区或路面破损）。设沿路径方向的速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，三个权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>，不适场为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，则单位路程代价大致为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（按路程归一）</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{\\alpha + \\beta\\,T + \\gamma\\,g}{1}\\quad\\text{（按路程归一）},\\qquad T = \\frac{1}{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（按路程归一）</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>时间项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta T = \\beta / f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是拥堵规避的来源：哪里挤（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 小），时间代价就高，人群自然避开。</p>\n<p>最后，求&quot;从任意点到目标的最小累计代价&quot;这个全局问题，等价于求解一个<strong>Eikonal 方程</strong>（一种各向异性的程函方程）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\|\\nabla \\phi(\\vec{x})\\| = C(\\vec{x}, \\nabla\\phi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是势场，边界条件是目标区域处 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。解出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 后，每个 agent 只需沿 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\nabla\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 方向移动，就走在了&quot;考虑了全局拥堵的最优路径&quot;上。数值上用<strong>快速行进法</strong>（Fast Marching Method）或快速扫描法在网格上求解，复杂度与网格分辨率相关、与 agent 数量无关——这正是它对超大规模人群高效的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与微观方法的取舍\">与微观方法的取舍</h2><p>连续介质人群和微观模型不是替代关系，而是各擅胜场。下表把两条路线摆在一起，对照着看才能选对工具。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>连续介质（宏观）</th>\n<th>社会力/Boids（微观）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本随规模</td>\n<td>与 agent 数无关，只看网格</td>\n<td>随 agent 数线性增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共同目标人群</td>\n<td>极擅长、流动自然</td>\n<td>可行但每人独立规划昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个体异质性</td>\n<td>弱（按组共享场）</td>\n<td>强（每人可不同参数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避障/避堵</td>\n<td>内建在势场求解里</td>\n<td>需显式避让逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近距离碰撞</td>\n<td>不精确，可能轻微重叠</td>\n<td>精确（接触力/速度障碍）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标/分组</td>\n<td>每组一套场，组数多则成本叠加</td>\n<td>天然支持任意目标混杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见且强大的工程做法是<strong>两层混合</strong>：用连续介质（或更轻量的流场，见 <a href=\"../navigation/crowd-navmesh\">人群与导航网格</a>）决定宏观流向，再用 <a href=\"../navigation/rvo-orca\">RVO 与 ORCA 避障</a> 在近距离做精确的个体避让。宏观负责&quot;往哪流、避开堵点&quot;，微观负责&quot;贴身不撞&quot;，各取所长。这套分工在现代 RTS 和大规模人群中相当主流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"局限与现代演进\">局限与现代演进</h2><p>连续介质人群的代价不容忽视：势场求解对每个目标组是一次全网格运算，目标组一多，成本就线性叠加，因此它最适合&quot;少数几个共同目标 + 海量 agent&quot;的情形，不适合每人各奔东西的市井场景。此外网格分辨率限制了精细度，狭窄通道可能被一个格子糊掉。</p>\n<p>近年的研究在两个方向上推进：一是把场求解搬上 GPU、做成实时增量更新，让动态环境（障碍移动、目标变化）也能跑；二是与数据驱动方法结合，2025 年前后出现了用强化学习和视觉-语言模型为人群注入更拟人决策的框架（如学术界的 TaiCrowd 高性能框架与 CrowdVLA 这类上下文感知 agent 工作），但这些更多面向仿真研究而非实时游戏。对游戏而言，经典连续介质思想的精简版——流场寻路（flow field pathfinding）——才是落地主力，它会在 <a href=\"../navigation/crowd-navmesh\">人群与导航网格</a> 里详谈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>连续介质人群把人群当作流体，用一个全局势场一次性决定所有人的流向，成本与 agent 数无关、只看网格。</li>\n<li>流程是：密度场 → 速度场（越挤越慢）→ 代价场（路程+时间+不适）→ 解 Eikonal 方程得势场 → 沿负梯度移动。</li>\n<li>时间代价项让人群自动绕开拥堵，避障与避堵被融进同一次场求解，无需显式避让逻辑。</li>\n<li>它擅长&quot;少数共同目标+海量 agent&quot;，但弱于个体异质性与近距离精确碰撞，常与 RVO 做两层混合。</li>\n<li>游戏中的落地主力是其精简版流场寻路；前沿研究在 GPU 实时化与数据驱动拟人决策上演进。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章对照：<a href=\"social-force-model\">社会力模型</a>——逐个体的微观路线，与本篇互为镜像。</li>\n<li>同章应用：<a href=\"density-flow-control\">密度与流量控制</a>——把速度场背后的密度-速度关系展开。</li>\n<li>跨库：势场/Eikonal 的离散表亲是网格上的 A*，见 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/foundations/a-star-algorithm\">寻路 · A* 算法</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"连续介质人群","id":"连续介质人群"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从密度场到速度场","id":"从密度场到速度场"},{"level":2,"text":"代价场与 Eikonal 方程","id":"代价场与-eikonal-方程"},{"level":2,"text":"与微观方法的取舍","id":"与微观方法的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"局限与现代演进","id":"局限与现代演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"社会力模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/crowds/social-force-model"},"next":{"title":"密度与流量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/crowds/density-flow-control"}}